## Prohibited

- `opencode` without `--agent` → vv-controller (default agent, explores project)
- `terminal send` for task → no lifecycle preamble, worker_done won't arrive
- Skipping `sleep 3` → race condition (dispatch before variant applied)
- `result.id` → correct: `result.task.id`
- Qwen Code without `--approval-mode yolo` → blocks orca commands
- Launching without checking model-card.md → model may be unavailable
- Writer + reviewer from same family → blind-spot risk
- Coordinator writing code → role lock violation
- Copy-paste bash from this file → build from `orca skills get orchestration`
